{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "006e3daa-7780-8509-8832-7e03d2328869",
  "created_at": "2026-03-13T10:32:53-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Elvis Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:30:36-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Happy Friday, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:30:41-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Beth, happy Friday to you too. My name's Elvis Fortes. I'm calling about a swing at one of the playgrounds, one of the beach parks. It's broken. And I'll tell you, that's a shame, because those parks are the best thing this city's got."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:30:56-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, thanks for letting us know. Which park is it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:31:02-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the playground down by the beach, off Bellevue. I'm at 149 Bellevue Avenue, so I walk past it every morning. One of the swings, the seat's hanging off one chain. Just dangling there. Somebody's going to get hurt, and honestly it looks bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:31:17-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not safe. Is it the one end of the swing set, or in the middle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:31:23-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The end one, closest to the parking lot. The chain on the left side is snapped. Rust, I'd say. Salt air eats everything, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:31:32-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It sure does. Okay, I'm putting that in for the parks crew right now. They'll tape it off or take the seat down so no one uses it. Do you want a call back, or are you all set?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:31:46-04:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm all set, no call needed. Hey, while I've got you, I got a long drive coming up, Newport down to Florida, so I'm building a playlist for the road. Seventeen hours and the radio's all ads, which is criminal. Any chance you know if the beach parks do anything with music in the summer? I'm just curious, good music in a park, that's civilized."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:32:08-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a great trip. For summer events I'd have to point you to our program schedule. It usually goes up on the city website in the spring, so check there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:32:19-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the city website, spring. Could you say that once more? I want to write it down. My memory's not what it was, and the pen's right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:32:29-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. The summer program schedule goes up on the City of Newport website, usually in the spring. Look under the Recreation Department page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:32:38-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. City website, Recreation page, spring. Perfect. Well, you've been a pleasure, Beth. Thanks for fixing that swing, the kids'll thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:32:46-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Elvis. Enjoy the drive and the playlist!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T10:32:50-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. You have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
